    LLM: 'Game: Whisky Poker. Logic: See rules.objective and rules.gameplay.',
    Player: 'Whisky Poker is a poker-style game with widow hand exchange. Multiple players. 5 each + 5-card widow. Options: swap entire hand for widow (old hand becomes new widow face-up), swap 1 card with widow, or knock (triggers final round). Last best poker hand after knock wins. Worst hand pays chip.',
    objective: 'Collect the best five-card poker hand by exchanging cards with the spare hand (widow) on the table. In standard play the best hand wins the pool; in the alternative form the worst hand pays one chip and the first to lose all chips pays for refreshments.',
    gameplay: 'Each turn: swap entire hand for widow (discards become face-up widow), swap 1 card, or knock. After knock = 1 final round. Showdown: standard poker rankings. Worst hand pays 1 chip. Out of chips = eliminated.',
